@smix8 I’m still reading through your comment, and the linked proposal, but one thing stood out to me:

> You can try lowering the error mentioned raster scale setting

The new error in 4.5 does not mention the raster scale setting anymore.

@smix8  Ok.  Thank you very much for this information.  I had no idea about any of this.  I am still very confused however.

The script example on the page you linked, is this meant to be a runtime script that you put in a _ready() function, or perhaps an editor script?  How does it relate to scenes?  Do I do it once for the entire project, or will it need to be ran once per scene?  If I run the script more than once will a bunch of Navigation Maps accumulate in my project?

I'm really struggling with how this script and my scenes will relate to one another.
